  - domain: 0
    displayName: Planning
    shortName: Planning
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: be604a7c3ef0a6546bffb4ab47f9d423, type: 3}
    hint: Planning means deciding what to do before a flood happens. With a plan, you will not have to guess when the water rises.
    greatMessage: You did great on Planning.
    goodMessage: You did well on Planning.
    weakMessage: You still have room to grow in Planning.
    mustDoTasks:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: ad1424c25aa5c4d49b6735d6e5b5b352, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: be5d49db71a17b445ba2b99ac69f5e46, type: 2}
  - domain: 1
    displayName: Training
    shortName: Training
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ad24c60a763c3a84fa80b95e84f3cc64, type: 3}
    hint: Training means knowing the right steps to stay safe. Doing them correctly helps prevent shocks and fires.
    greatMessage: You did great on Training.
    goodMessage: You did well on Training.
    weakMessage: You still have room to grow in Training.
    mustDoTasks:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ab07306cc304f17b9aa6934a40c5907, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: ec8e91a1de81e5d43b521b6274b5528d, type: 2}
