    displayName: Material Preparedness
    shortName: Material
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1ce28610cd7a89a48be59dd93e53d5a7, type: 3}
    hint: Material preparedness means having your supplies ready before a flood. When they are packed, you can leave right away.
    greatMessage: You did great on Material Preparedness.
    goodMessage: You did well on Material Preparedness.
    weakMessage: You still have room to grow in Material Preparedness.
    mustDoTasks:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ea2e202740d0bd4091af7065a13a130, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e234e705a054024982d53b5747243fe, type: 2}
